            },
            "reviewBody": "My family absolutely loves this. I have to make it at least once a month! Friends show up when they know I'm making it. I use corn tortillas instead and pour enchilada sauce on top instead of more salsa. Great flavor!!!",
            "datePublished": "2014-02-22T17:59:36.587Z"
