              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christina Myers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe! I made it mostly as stated, only changing one thing. Instead of pouring salsa over the rolled tortillas at the end, I used the small bit of filling I had left and mixed it with half a can of enchilada sauce and used that instead. So creamy and yummy! Came together in a snap too, easy prep and easy clean up. Thanks!",
