            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Shelli-Jason Clark The Clarks"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow!!! I made these almost as per the recipe (traded out green onions for regular onions) and I used corn tortillas. I'm confident the original recipe is amazing. The filling is rich and creamy. My husband loves cheese enchiladas and these did not disappoint! My finicky cheese-hating son devoured two enchiladas! This recipe is a keeper! The salsa is a great touch and a nice change from enchilada sauce. Thank you for sharing this delicious recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2017-06-12T02:15:01.237Z"
